# === THE MASTER CONDUCTOR ===
# y127 is an empty 128-step pattern set as the 'Master' (yp127).
# Because it is the master, any pattern launched with 'zq1' (queue start)
# will wait perfectly in sync until y127 reaches step 0 (the downbeat).
y127 %6 [] x127 yp127

